# Lifecycle state machine

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Acquired
  Acquired --> Landed : BP-LAND-01
  Landed --> Candidate : BP-ADAPT-01
  Candidate --> Resolved : BP-RESOLVE-01 BP-PARCEL-KEY-01
  Candidate --> Provisional : tier 3
  Provisional --> Resolved : BP-PROMOTE-01
  Resolved --> Reconciled : BP-RECON-01
  Reconciled --> Indexed : BP-WRITE-01 BP-EDGE-01
  Indexed --> Served : BP-SERVE-01
  Landed --> [*] : retention expires
```

Gates named match `_blueprint/30_lifecycle.md` and `40_rule_register.md`.
